(   * Dark Bottle \(DB\): Completely wrapped in opaque black tape and aluminum foil to exclude light;) Tj
T*
(   incubated alongside LB. Photosynthesis is halted; only cellular respiration occurs.) Tj
T*
(   - Calculation Formulas:) Tj
T*
(   * Community Respiration \(R\) = \(DO_initial - DO_dark\) / Delta t) Tj
T*
(   * Net Primary Productivity \(NPP\) = \(DO_light - DO_initial\) / Delta t) Tj
T*
(   * Gross Primary Productivity \(GPP\) = NPP + R = \(DO_light - DO_dark\) / Delta t) Tj
T*
(   - Conversion to Carbon: Dissolved oxygen values are converted to grams of carbon fixed using a) Tj
T*
(   Photosynthetic Quotient \(PQ = moles O2 released / moles CO2 assimilated, typically 1.15 to) Tj
T*
(   1.25\).) Tj
