(   eaten by small predators:) Tj
T*
(   Leaf Litter -> Fungi / Bacteria -> Nematode -> Predatory Mite -> Ground Beetle.) Tj
T*
(   Operates with temporal decoupling from solar radiation, utilizing accumulated chemical energy) Tj
T*
(   reserves.) Tj
T*
(   2. Ecosystem Energetic Partitioning:) Tj
T*
(   - Terrestrial Forest Ecosystems: The Detritus Food Chain dominates overwhelmingly! Over 85% to) Tj
T*
(   95% of Net Primary Production is NOT consumed by living herbivores; it falls as senescent leaf) Tj
T*
(   litter and woody debris directly into the DFC. High concentrations of indigestible structural) Tj
T*
(   biopolymers \(lignin, cellulose, tannins\) defend living foliage against grazing.) Tj
T*
(   - Open Ocean Pelagic Ecosystems: The Grazing Food Chain dominates! Planktonic microalgae) Tj
T*
(   \(diatoms, dinoflagellates\) lack woody supportive tissues, have low C:N ratios, and are rapidly) Tj
T*
(   ingested \(60% to 80% of NPP\) by pelagic micro-zooplankton and copepods.) Tj
