(   Invented in the early 20th century, the industrial Haber-Bosch catalytic synthesis:) Tj
T*
(   N2 \(g\) + 3 H2 \(g\) --[Fe catalyst, 450 deg C, 200 bar]--> 2 NH3 \(g\)) Tj
T*
(   Synthesizes over 120-150 Tg N/year of reactive chemical fertilizer. Together with fossil fuel) Tj
T*
(   combustion \(producing NOx\), human activity has more than doubled the global terrestrial flux of) Tj
T*
(   reactive nitrogen, breaching planetary boundaries.) Tj
T*
(   3. Downstream Ecological Cascades and Eutrophication:) Tj
T*
(   - Agricultural leaching: Excess nitrate \(NO3-\) is highly water-soluble and mobile, leaching) Tj
T*
(   from crop fields into freshwater streams, rivers, and coastal estuaries.) Tj
T*
(   - Algal Blooms: High nitrogen inputs stimulate explosive phytoplankton and cyanobacterial) Tj
T*
(   blooms \(e.g., Microcystis\).) Tj
T*
(   - Anoxia & Dead Zones: When the massive algal biomass dies, aerobic heterotrophic bacteria) Tj
T*
(   decompose the detritus, consuming dissolved oxygen \(DO drops below 2.0 mg/L, hypoxia\),) Tj
T*
(   resulting in catastrophic mortality of benthic invertebrates and pelagic fish populations) Tj
T*
(   \(e.g., Gulf of Mexico and Baltic Sea dead zones\).) Tj
