(   [Problem Statement]: Formulate Darcy's Law for groundwater flow in porous media, define hydraulic conductivity, and explain the development of a Pumping Cone of Depression.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Groundwater Hydrogeology, Darcy's Law, and Well Hydraulics:) Tj
T*
(   1. Formulation of Darcy's Law \(Henry Darcy, 1856\):) Tj
T*
(   Darcy's empirical law describes the laminar flow of fluid through a porous medium:) Tj
T*
(   Q = -K * A * \(dh / dl\)) Tj
T*
(   Where:) Tj
T*
(   - Q: Total volumetric groundwater discharge rate \(m3/s or m3/day\).) Tj
T*
