(   * Shockley-Queisser Theoretical Limit: Single-junction silicon PV is limited to a theoretical) Tj
T*
(   maximum efficiency of ~33.7% due to thermal relaxation of excess photon energy and transparency) Tj
T*
(   to sub-bandgap photons.) Tj
T*
(   2. Concentrated Solar Power \(CSP\) Thermal Systems:) Tj
T*
(   - Operating Principle: Uses mirrors \(parabolic troughs, central power towers, parabolic dishes\)) Tj
T*
(   to concentrate direct beam solar irradiance onto a central heat receiver, heating a working) Tj
T*
(   fluid to 400-600 deg C to drive a conventional Rankine steam turbine.) Tj
T*
(   - Molten-Salt Thermal Energy Storage \(TES\):) Tj
T*
(   * Working Media: Eutectic mixture of 60% sodium nitrate \(NaNO3\) and 40% potassium nitrate) Tj
T*
(   \(KNO3\).) Tj
T*
(   * High specific heat capacity \(1.5 kJ/kg.K\) and stability up to 565 deg C.) Tj
T*
(   * Hot molten salt is stored in insulated atmospheric tanks during the day and dispatched) Tj
T*
(   through heat exchangers to generate high-pressure steam after sunset, enabling baseload,) Tj
T*
(   dispatchable solar power without chemical batteries.) Tj
