(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze Geothermal Power Generation thermodynamic cycles, contrasting Dry Steam, Flash Steam, and Binary Organic Rankine Cycle \(ORC\) power plants.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Thermodynamics and Engineering Configurations of Geothermal Power Plants:) Tj
T*
(   1. Geothermal Enthalpy Regimes:) Tj
T*
(   Earth's internal heat originates from primordial planetary accretion and ongoing radiogenic) Tj
T*
(   decay of long-lived radioisotopes \(U-238, Th-232, K-40\) in the mantle and crust. Geothermal) Tj
T*
(   resources are classified by fluid temperature: High enthalpy \(> 200 deg C\), Medium enthalpy) Tj
T*
(   \(150-200 deg C\), and Low enthalpy \(< 150 deg C\).) Tj
T*
(   2. The Three Thermodynamic Power Cycles:) Tj
T*
(   - Dry Steam Power Plants:) Tj
T*
(   * Resource: High-enthalpy vapor-dominated reservoirs \(e.g., The Geysers, California;) Tj
T*
(   Larderello, Italy\).) Tj
T*
(   * Process: High-pressure dry steam is extracted directly from production wells, passed through) Tj
T*
(   cyclone separators to remove abrasive mineral rock particulates, and expanded directly through) Tj
T*
(   a steam turbine driving an electrical generator. Clean, simple, and highest thermal efficiency) Tj
T*
(   among geothermal systems.) Tj
T*
(   - Flash Steam Power Plants:) Tj
T*
(   * Resource: High-temperature, liquid-dominated hydrothermal reservoirs \(> 180 deg C\) kept under) Tj
T*
(   high subterranean hydrostatic pressure.) Tj
T*
(   * Process: Deep pressurized brine ascends to the surface where pressure drops suddenly in a) Tj
T*
(   flash separator vessel. The pressure reduction causes a fraction of the boiling brine to) Tj
T*
(   violently 'flash' into steam, which is ducted to a steam turbine. Residual brine is re-injected) Tj
T*
