T*
(   3. The UN REDD+ Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   Established under the UNFCCC, REDD+ stands for 'Reducing Emissions from Deforestation and) Tj
T*
(   forest Degradation in developing countries; and the role of conservation, sustainable) Tj
T*
