(   [Problem Statement]: Formulate the Vollenweider Empirical Phosphorus Loading Model, and describe lake restoration techniques using Alum precipitation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Vollenweider Eutrophication Model and Chemical Lake Inactivation with Alum:) Tj
T*
(   1. Richard Vollenweider's Empirical Phosphorus Mass-Balance Model \(1968\):) Tj
T*
(   Vollenweider established that the in-lake total phosphorus concentration [P]_lake \(mg/m3\) at) Tj
T*
(   steady state is determined by phosphorus areal loading rate, lake mean depth, and hydraulic) Tj
T*
(   flushing rate:) Tj
T*
(   [P]_lake = L_p / [ q_s * \(1 + sqrt\(tau_w\)\) ]) Tj
T*
(   Where:) Tj
T*
(   - L_p: Areal total phosphorus loading rate \(mg P/m2/yr\).) Tj
T*
(   - q_s: Areal water loading rate or hydraulic overflow rate \(m/yr\), calculated as mean lake) Tj
T*
(   depth z divided by hydraulic residence time: q_s = z / tau_w.) Tj
T*
(   - tau_w: Hydraulic residence time of the lake \(years\).) Tj
T*
(   - Critical Threshold: If [P]_lake exceeds 20 to 30 mg/m3 \(micrograms/L\), the lake shifts from) Tj
T*
(   mesotrophic to a highly eutrophic state dominated by nuisance cyanobacterial scums.) Tj
T*
(   2. Chemical Lake Restoration via Alum \(Aluminum Sulfate\) Inactivation:) Tj
T*
(   - Chemical Precipitation & Inactivation Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   Liquid aluminum sulfate [Al2\(SO4\)3.14H2O] is injected into the hypolimnetic water column. In) Tj
T*
(   neutral water \(pH 6.5 to 7.5\), alum hydrolyzes into insoluble, amorphous aluminum hydroxide) Tj
T*
(   floc [Al\(OH\)3]:) Tj
T*
(   Al3+ + 3 H2O <-> Al\(OH\)3 \(am\) + 3 H+) Tj
T*
(   - Orthophosphate Co-precipitation:) Tj
T*
(   Soluble orthophosphate ions are chemically adsorbed onto aluminum hydroxide flocs or) Tj
T*
(   co-precipitate as aluminum hydroxyphosphate:) Tj
T*
(   Al\(OH\)3 \(am\) + H2PO4- -> Al\(OH\)2\(H2PO4\) \(s\) + OH-) Tj
T*
(   - Benthic Capping:) Tj
T*
(   The dense Al\(OH\)3 floc settles to the lake floor, forming a cohesive 2 to 5-centimeter barrier) Tj
T*
(   over the anoxic sediment. Even when hypolimnetic water becomes completely anaerobic \(anoxia\),) Tj
T*
(   aluminum does NOT reduce \(unlike ferric iron Fe3+ which reduces to soluble Fe2+, releasing) Tj
T*
(   bound P\). The alum blanket permanently intercepts and sequesters upward internal diffusive) Tj
T*
(   phosphorus fluxes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
