(   2. Coastal Hydrodynamic Attenuation:) Tj
T*
(   - The complex three-dimensional lattice of mangrove prop roots acts as an exceptional porous) Tj
T*
(   hydrodynamic breakwater.) Tj
T*
(   - Wave Energy Dissipation: Numerical modeling reveals that a 100-meter-wide belt of mature) Tj
T*
(   mangrove forest dissipates 66% of wave kinetic energy, reducing storm surge heights during) Tj
T*
